Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:09.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 18 \N {\fs100} Seven Harmful Quirks {なくて七くせの巻}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.34,0:00:24.39,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Today we'll introduce you \Nto different types of women.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.77,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.11,0:00:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's certain. \NI remember his face and his mustache, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.74,0:00:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.91,0:00:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the face of the old man \Nfrom my prophetic dream. {lit: dream divination}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.22,0:00:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forget his loach-like mustache! {assuming this dojou is loach, not something else}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.10,0:00:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I knew you'd come! \NI saw you in a dream.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's an exceptional beauty!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.12,0:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.01,0:00:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You like her?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.90,0:01:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.09,0:01:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart hasn’t felt such excitement \Nin quite some time.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.95,0:01:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'd like to bring her home at once, and...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.74,0:01:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.56,0:01:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, bad timing... {mazui?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.71,0:01:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.79,0:01:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.70,0:01:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, nothing of interest.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.78,0:01:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.10,0:01:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's anything but boring. \NShe's exquisite!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:54.52,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if your lying down...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're upside down...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.65,0:02:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful things are beautiful.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.51,0:02:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I must bring her to life at once! {lit: at once, reviving technique}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.60,0:02:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow, Honey.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:12.57,0:02:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pillow? Yes, certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.81,0:02:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is she inviting me? {囃しいで}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.42,0:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's what I want.\NWell then, here I go.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.18,0:02:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Honey. \NWon't you bring some water for me?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:25.20,0:02:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, so you're thirsty? \NYes, certainly.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:28.23,0:02:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, your water.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.51,0:02:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, scratch my hand. {??????????????????? no clue what's that kaite}{掻いて}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:31.85,0:02:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You could scratch it with the oth— {?????????????????? lit: as much as the tip of the hand, yourself could... - still no clue what this or previous line is about}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.73,0:02:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, I mean, no problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.52,0:02:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take off my shoes.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.00,0:02:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Heat the room.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's heating!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.71,0:02:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Empty the bath. {お風呂を開かして}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The bath is empty!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.34,0:02:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,On second thought, you take it first.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.83,0:02:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even lie beside her! {?????????}{そばへ寄れないじゃないか}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.85,0:03:02.00,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The lazy woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.10,0:03:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.67,0:03:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, that won't do!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.51,0:03:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I need someone else, \Nnot this lazy woman!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.67,0:03:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.88,0:03:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.00,0:03:37.89,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The chatty Woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.89,0:03:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, she is even prettier than the last one.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All right... Come alive! {???? korenara ee?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.48,0:03:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, goodness me, would you look at what a lovely man I've got! {OH GOD WHAT HAVE I GOTTEN MYSELF INTO}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.14,0:03:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By God, I love the shape of your ears!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.66,0:03:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And your eyes are also \Nappropriately round—just right!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.30,0:03:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he's also a bit chubby, though, \Nbut his kimono choice is exquisite. I'm delighted!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.48,0:03:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kimonos are important, \Nlike when I see a person pass by,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.78,0:03:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,wearing the same kimono as yesterday, \Nit repulses me! {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet she has \Nsix children back home,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.81,0:04:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,speaking of kids, all the kids back home were all so awfully mean, oh, you wouldn't believe it!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.49,0:04:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but speaking of mean, they all \Ncan't hold a candle to the neighbor's cat,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it bumped into me the other day and... {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.36,0:04:11.18,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Enough! I can't stand this endless jabbering!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.58,0:04:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, speaking of awful, the neighbor's wife was truly such an awful...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.70,0:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good either.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong this time?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.53,0:04:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.93,0:04:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to where I was, my neighbor's wife there is so lazy, and she had bandages all... {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.33,0:04:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.69,0:04:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Talkative women are too energetic for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.68,0:04:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, this should be good.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.11,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this time, surely...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.28,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.00,0:04:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,See, for my baby... {???? maybe watashi no akachan?}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I really, really want a brooch.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't, no... {???????? ikenai?}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.00,0:05:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, must be your maternal instincts? {母性本能だね; honestly idk what to make of it}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.93,0:05:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's all right with me, I understand it. {???????}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.84,0:05:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want a kimono \Nthat'd look good with my earrings.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:09.36,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly, coming up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.87,0:05:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a three-sided mirror.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.08,0:05:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, by all means. Come to think of it, \Nmy place is rather empty and dull. {lit: doesn't have richness; warmth; interest; taste; charm}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.15,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Some women's accessories would do it good.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want a car.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.21,0:05:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Car... Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.58,0:05:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Car... I guess I'll get that sorted too.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.68,0:05:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, darling, you're something else!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.87,0:05:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one more thing I want, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.48,0:05:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me three boys aged 16 or 17, five young men \Naged 24 or 25, and two men aged 45 or 46. {?????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????? no clue why she'd ever need any of that, but I have no clue what else she could be talking about}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop messing with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.71,0:05:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Such greediness!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.81,0:05:45.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The greedy woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.57,0:06:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, it'll be good.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.30,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even wait until I got home.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.16,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My stomach is growling...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.96,0:06:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? That's not good. \NI'll get you something to eat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.29,0:06:14.32,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The gluttonous woman. {/eating well}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.57,0:06:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be shy.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.24,0:06:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.79,0:06:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the ultimate bliss!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.57,0:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... I hope this isn't another dead end.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.32,0:06:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this is your home from today on.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.77,0:06:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you happy?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.94,0:06:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.67,0:06:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. My lovely wife, \Nplease be generous to me. {????}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.82,0:07:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.29,0:07:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.54,0:07:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Another dead end, after all?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.50,0:07:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good day! What's wrong? \NYou're in such a rush.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing serious. \NSee you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope this one makes for a good wife.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.64,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can't stand you! {this word is killing me, it seems the women here use it when they're jealous but idk what english word to choose for it; lit: frustrating}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.09,0:07:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was that woman \Nyou talked to on the way?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.20,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's just...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it already, enough stalling! {?????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.32,0:07:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, th-that was...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.40,0:07:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Um! The smell. I can smell it!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.01,0:07:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That suspicious, sweet smell!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.76,0:07:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.13,0:07:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.95,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cruelty... Do you know how cruel a woman can be? {????????????? }{執念}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.89,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.37,0:07:47.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The jealous woman.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.35,0:07:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! She's no good!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No way I can live with a woman that jealous!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.63,0:07:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the last scroll I have.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.75,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If this one's no good either, \Nyou'd better just forget about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.89,0:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this woman?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.80,0:08:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm! She looks like the prettiest creature under the heavens! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.02,0:08:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This cloud's racing, and so is my heart. {??????????? assuming this ki is 気 but still no clue what he means} {just like the cloud he's on is racing, his heart is too}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.01,0:08:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my final chance! {/last resort}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.23,0:08:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks promising this time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stare at me so much...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.57,0:08:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,My... Oh, my...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, hold on... Hold on a minute...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.92,0:09:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.70,0:09:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, wait just a minute, okay? \NLet's eat first, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.81,0:09:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew, I need to calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.57,0:09:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I just entered and this happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.39,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey-hey! Watch who you're kissing! {lit: making mistake is a no go}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.52,0:09:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.23,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm burning over here! {referring to her manko}{could be burning with passion too, you dirty Dildo}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.96,0:09:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not so fast, please... {/step back}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.52,0:09:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.36,0:09:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning... I can't hold it back!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.87,0:09:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.67,0:09:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Let me go, I need to go put out the fire.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.95,0:10:01.58,Overlap,,0,0,0,,No... 
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.58,0:10:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Then give me a replacement, \Nsomeone to quench {\i1}my{\i0} fire...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.14,0:10:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm burning... I'm burning through!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.35,0:10:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch-ouch!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.20,0:10:18.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,She was a nymphomaniac woman,\Nwho easily got heated. {/excessively sensual}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.61,0:10:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.07,0:10:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, maybe it's time to stop? {??? think I heart "you learned your lesson?/had enough?"}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.61,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to her, I prefer the previous women.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.66,0:10:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I say, women sure are scary.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.20,0:10:38.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Did this episode make anyone \Nout there give up on women?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.19,0:10:46.96,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But believe me, the finest woman is she who borrows a touch from every archetype shown thus far. {True.....}
